{"id":"steam-1417460","steam":1417460,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Friendly Arena","summary":"If you ever wanted a chaotic multiplayer game, Friendly Arena is all about that, it's a casual, physics based and multiplayer game with up to 20 players and set in fun/chaotic minigames","about":"Friendly Arena is a fun physics-based multiplayer game that's set in a dangerous and fun minigames to be played with up to 20 players as team based which you can play with your family, friends or random players across the globe.\r\n\r\nGame Elements:\r\n- Can be played as singleplayer with bots (from 1 bot to a max of 39)\r\n- Can be played as multiplayer with up to 20 players (without bots)\r\n- Active ragdoll physics\r\n- Drive-able Vehicles  \r\n- Free Loot Boxes\r\n- Shared splitscreen with up to 4 players and bots (currently doesn't work in multiplayer)\r\n- Create your own Levels using UE4 Editor and share through the Steam workshop\r\n- Player customization so each player will look different\r\n- Ability to create your own server \r\n- Daily missions\r\n- Alot of Game Modes to choose from\r\n- Vehicle Customization\r\n\r\nDevelopment Roadmap:\r\nFriendly Arena is being developed in early access with alot of new updates including new maps, new game modes and new features\r\n\r\n- Bots working in multiplayer\r\n- Pets working in multiplayer\r\n- Shared splitscreen working in multiplayer\r\n- Ability to customize pets\r\n- Up to 20 Game Modes\r\n- Game Achievements\r\n- alot of random main menu scenes","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417460/library_600x900.jpg?t=1724103800","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417460/header.jpg?t=1724103800","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417460/library_hero.jpg?t=1724103800","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417460/header.jpg?t=1724103800","background":null